---
import Logo from './Logo.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="footer-cta">
      <svg class="cta-orbit" viewBox="0 0 520 200" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
        <ellipse cx="300" cy="120" rx="250" ry="62" transform="rotate(-12 300 120)" />
        <ellipse cx="300" cy="120" rx="180" ry="40" transform="rotate(-12 300 120)" />
        <circle cx="497" cy="72" r="3" />
      </svg>
      <div class="cta-copy">
        <p class="cta-title">9 档套餐，按需开始灵动连接</p>
        <p class="cta-text tnum">月付 ¥20/月起 · 年付 ¥99/年 · 流量包 ¥199 起 · 至尊私人定制 ¥680/月</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href={SITE.registerUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">立即注册</a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/#pricing">查看套餐</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-top">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <a class="f-brand" href="/" aria-label="灵动云官网首页">
          <Logo size={40} />
        </a>
        <p>灵动云官网介绍品牌、9 档套餐与所有套餐共用的服务规则，并提供注册入口。客户端教程、套餐选择、问题排查和新手步骤，分别由四个官方站点负责。</p>
        <ul class="f-facts">
          <li><span>官网</span><a href="/">lingdongyun.site</a></li>
          <li><span>用户中心</span><a href={SITE.registerUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">注册 / 登录</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <nav class="footer-nav" aria-label="页脚导航">
        <div>
          <p class="fh">官网首页</p>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="/#pricing">9 档套餐价格</a></li>
            <li><a href="/#service">服务说明</a></li>
            <li><a href="/#sites">灵动云官方站点</a></li>
            <li><a href="/#faq">常见问题</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="fh">官网资料</p>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="/guides/">资料目录</a></li>
            <li><a href="/guides/plan-selection/">套餐价格与服务说明</a></li>
            <li><a href="/guides/lingdongyun-official/">官方站点说明</a></li>
            <li><a href="/sitemap/">网站地图</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="fh">账户</p>
          <ul>
            <li><a href={SITE.registerUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">注册新账号</a></li>
            <li><a href="/guides/plan-selection/#custom">至尊私人定制说明</a></li>
            <li><a href="/guides/plan-selection/#support">售后与客服渠道</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <p class="f-statement">灵动云官网 · <a href="/">lingdongyun.site</a>。灵动云另设使用指南、套餐选择、帮助中心、新手入门四个官方站点，详见「<a href="/guides/lingdongyun-official/">官方站点说明</a>」。</p>
      <div class="f-meta">
        <p>价格与套餐规则以用户中心实时显示为准。</p>
        <p>© 2026 {SITE.brand} · {SITE.brandEn}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    position: relative;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg) 0%, #03050a 100%);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--muted);
    padding: 64px 0 32px;
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .site-footer a:not(.btn) { color: var(--text-2); }
  .site-footer a:not(.btn):hover { color: #fff; }

  /* 收尾行动区：深色面板 + 两条淡轨道线 */
  .footer-cta {
    position: relative; overflow: hidden; isolation: isolate;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px 40px; flex-wrap: wrap;
    padding: 40px 48px; border-radius: var(--r-lg); margin-bottom: 64px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(120% 140% at 100% 0%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.22) 0%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0) 55%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #0d1628 0%, #0a101d 100%);
    border: 1px solid var(--line-2);
    box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  }
  .cta-orbit { position: absolute; right: -40px; top: -30px; width: 520px; height: auto; z-index: -1; pointer-events: none; }
  .cta-orbit ellipse { fill: none; stroke: var(--accent-hi); stroke-opacity: 0.2; stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 2 8; stroke-linecap: round; }
  .cta-orbit ellipse + ellipse { stroke-opacity: 0.12; stroke-dasharray: none; }
  .cta-orbit circle { fill: #e8f1ff; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 6px rgba(196, 181, 253, 0.9)); }
  .cta-title { font-size: clamp(22px, 2.4vw, 28px); font-weight: 600; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: 0.01em; }
  .cta-text { margin-top: 10px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 15px; }
  .cta-actions { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }

  .footer-top { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 2fr; gap: 64px; padding-bottom: 48px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .f-brand { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; }
  .footer-brand > p { margin-top: 20px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.85; max-width: 30em; }
  .f-facts { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 16px 0 0; display: grid; font-size: 14px; }
  .f-facts li { display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: center; }
  .f-facts span { color: var(--faint); min-width: 4.5em; }
  .f-facts a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 40px; }

  .footer-nav { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 32px; }
  .footer-nav .fh { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 8px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
  .footer-nav ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; }
  .footer-nav a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 40px; font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--muted) !important; }
  .footer-nav a:hover { color: #fff !important; }

  .footer-bottom { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 8px 32px; padding-top: 24px; font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--faint); }
  .f-statement { color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; max-width: 46em; }
  /* 句中链接：扩大可点击区域，不改变行高 */
  .f-statement a { padding: 10px 2px; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; text-decoration-color: rgba(196, 181, 253, 0.4); }
  .f-statement a:hover { text-decoration-color: currentColor; }
  .f-meta { display: grid; gap: 2px; text-align: right; }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .footer-top { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .site-footer { padding-top: 48px; }
    .footer-nav { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px; }
    .footer-cta { padding: 28px 20px; margin-bottom: 48px; border-radius: var(--r); }
    .cta-orbit { width: 380px; right: -120px; top: -40px; }
    .cta-actions { width: 100%; }
    .cta-actions .btn { flex: 1 1 140px; }
    .footer-bottom { flex-direction: column; }
    .f-meta { text-align: left; }
  }
</style>
